DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-08-10T09:04:08&endDate=2026-08-11T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nSevere delays between Hayes & Harlington and Heathrow Airport due to a tunnel being closed for safety reasons. Please use the Piccadilly line to travel between Heathrow Airport and Central London. MINOR DELAYS between Whitechapel and Shenfield while we fix a faulty train at Gidea Park. GOOD SERVICE on the rest of the line. Tickets are being accepted on London Underground and London Buses. . 
